 "For these specific physical constants (and feedback control constants), the \
linearized system with feedback control is predicted to be ",
 StyleBox["unstable",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontVariations->{"Underline"->True}],
 " and therefore the nonlinear system cannot be predicted to be \
asymptotically stable for the pendulum configured in the vertical position."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2de1a1c5-197c-48af-b073-285b331b0a47"],

