 " Feedback Control"
}], "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"61983af6-89cc-4be2-adb5-c862554c0845"],

Cell["\<\
Specific values for the feedback control coefficients c1 and c2 will be \
chosen in order to insure that the pendulum problem will be asymptotically \
stable in the vertical position:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ecba10cf-d9b6-44aa-b82d-2581516173f1"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"g", "=", " ", "32.2"}], ";"}], "\n", 
