Cell["\<\
For these specific physical constants (and feedback control constants), the \
linearized system with feedback control is predicted to be asymptotically \
stable and therefore the nonlinear system is also predicted to be \
asymptotically stable for the pendulum configured in the vertical position.
The vector field with feedback control is:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fbfc3f3e-9822-41f1-aaa6-7b2dea826d3b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"graph1", "=", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
